'''Karin Nekozuka''' (猫塚かりん) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Karin Nekozuka
|image = E 381.png
|appearance = [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,600¢ - 6,320¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health, mediocre attack power, is somewhat fast, and can [[Freeze]] Cats for 2 seconds. Its not much of a threatening enemy as she is supported by rather weak peons in the stages she appears in. In her debut stage she is at a very low magnification of 3%, making her initial stats extremely lower than what they are in her second appearance.

==Strategy==
Obviously units that outrange her can deal damage at a safe distance, such as [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]], [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Drone Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], etc. Units that are [[:Category:Resist Freeze Cats|Resistant to Freeze]] can deal damage to her while also nullifying her ability.

